OL,5,G2100 Long Lost Family: Born Without
OL,6,G     Trace
OL,7,     FWhen a box containing a newborn
OL,8,     Fbaby was found on Halloween night
OL,9,     Fin 1996, the two women who saw a
OL,10,     Fhand peeking out first suspected
OL,11,     Fit was a trick. Instead, it was
OL,12,     FMichael - tiny and premature. Now
OL,13,     Fan adult, he wants to know who it
OL,14,     Fwas that left him there, and why?
OL,15,     FSimilar questions have haunted
OL,16,     F77-year-old Christine, who was
OL,17,     Fdiscovered in a Waterloo train
OL,18,     Fcarriage. But she has more reason
OL,19,     Fthan many other foundlings to
OL,20,     Funderstand why a mother might give
OL,21,     Fup a child. Davina McCall and
OL,22,     FNicky Campbell host
